#. ~ Description of "fungal fluid sac"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"A fluid bladder from a fungus-based lifeform.  Not very nutritious, but safe "
"to eat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "raw potato"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"A potato, mildly toxic and not very tasty raw.  Delicious and filling when "
"properly cooked."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cooking banana"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"A much less sweet and more starchy relative of the banana; unlike dessert "
"bananas, they usually are eaten cooked rather than raw, and can be processed "
"into flour.  They are a staple food in tropical regions of the world.  Also "
"known as plantains."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pumpkin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"A large gourd, about the size of a person's head.  It'll require some "
"disassembly before use."
msgstr ""

