#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"Dried leaves of a tropical plant.  You can boil them into green tea, or you "
"can just eat them raw.  They're pretty gross and not too filling that way, "
"though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tomato"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
