#. ~ Description of "prepared ground nuts"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Ground nuts that have been peeled and then boiled, to destroy the harmful "
"protease inhibitors.  Safe to eat, but need further cooking to become "
"palatable.  Can be used much like potatoes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "boiled ground nuts"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Boiled ground nuts.  They look and taste a little like potatoes, but with a "
"slight nutty taste."
msgstr ""

